# AZDO Branch Policies

Before merge:

1. Minimum required reviewer approvals (team policy: 1–2)
2. CI / build validation on the PR branch is green
3. All PR comments are resolved
4. Azure DevOps work item is linked to the PR

Do not merge with failing CI or unresolved blocking comments.
